  "courseSlug": "react-native-the-practical-guide",
  "courseTitle": "React Native - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197368",
      "title": "Handling Events",
      "lectureOrder": 22,
      "videoOrder": 19,
      "sourceHash": "5eb42792cc298a4aac37e06a15561e443b07e863658ef4eb2d525445e69c9789",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "So we did add some styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 5.62,
          "en": "and a basic layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.62,
          "end": 6.86,
          "en": "This is nice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.86,
          "end": 9.13,
          "en": "but of course, not all we wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.13,
          "end": 10.47,
          "en": "In most apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 12.61,
          "en": "no matter if we're talking about web apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.61,
          "end": 14.59,
          "en": "or native mobile apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 14.59,
          "end": 18.1,
          "en": "we also want to allow the user to interact with the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.1,
          "end": 20.65,
          "en": "And we got a text input here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.65,
          "end": 23.42,
          "en": "and we also got a button that could be pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.42,
          "end": 24.53,
          "en": "but at the moment, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 24.53,
          "end": 26.44,
          "en": "nothing happens if you type here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.44,
          "end": 28.04,
          "en": "or if you press this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 28.04,
          "end": 29.88,
          "en": "this is ignored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 29.88,
          "end": 31.38,
          "en": "And this is ignored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 31.38,
          "end": 34.05,
          "en": "because we're not handling these events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "And just as with a web app that you're building with React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 39.74,
          "en": "you, of course, need to handle them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 39.74,
          "end": 41.66,
          "en": "if you want something to happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 41.66,
          "end": 45.71,
          "en": "The good news is that you do handle events in the same way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.71,
          "end": 48.43,
          "en": "you would do it in web apps though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.43,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "You can add event listeners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 53.35,
          "en": "and connect them to event handler functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 53.35,
          "end": 56.68,
          "en": "and you can manage state in your components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 56.68,
          "end": 58.73,
          "en": "with the useState Hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.73,
          "end": 61.88,
          "en": "just as you would do it in any other React app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 61.88,
          "end": 64.43,
          "en": "Because this is just a React app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 64.43,
          "end": 65.87,
          "en": "the only difference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 65.87,
          "end": 66.703,
          "en": "as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 66.703,
          "end": 68.5,
          "en": "in the first course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 68.5,
          "end": 72.07,
          "en": "compared to a React app that targets the web",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 72.07,
          "end": 74.53999999999999,
          "en": "is that we use a different platform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 74.53999999999999,
          "end": 77.57,
          "en": "with React Native instead of React DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 77.57,
          "end": 80.42,
          "en": "But when it comes to React's core features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 80.42,
          "end": 83.78,
          "en": "like handling events or managing state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 83.78,
          "end": 86.38,
          "en": "that all works in exactly the same way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 86.38,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "as you know it from React for the web.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 92.16,
          "en": "And here I got two events that I wanna handle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 92.16,
          "end": 94.63,
          "en": "The first one would be a click on this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.63,
          "end": 96.39,
          "en": "but before we handle that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 96.39,
          "end": 100.9,
          "en": "I also wanna handle keystrokes on that TextInput element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.9,
          "end": 103.85,
          "en": "so that I can grab the value the user entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.85,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "and so that we can then use this value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "to finally add a new goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 110.56,
          "en": "in this list of goals as a next step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.56,
          "end": 111.393,
          "en": "And therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 111.393,
          "end": 114,
          "en": "these are the first two things I wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114,
          "end": 115.37,
          "en": "I will add a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 116.22999999999999,
          "end": 119.217,
          "en": "that could be called goalInputHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 123.44,
          "en": "that is responsible for fetching that user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 123.44,
          "end": 124.803,
          "en": "as the user types.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.71,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "Then I'll another function addGoalHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 132.913,
          "en": "which should be fired when this button here is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 134.66,
          "end": 136.53,
          "en": "Now to connect those functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 136.53,
          "end": 139.96,
          "en": "we use special event listening props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 139.96,
          "end": 143.593,
          "en": "that are provided by React Native on its components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 144.62,
          "end": 145.453,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 145.453,
          "end": 147.35,
          "en": "to connect goalInputHandler to TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 148.55,
          "end": 153.54,
          "en": "we can add the special onChangeText prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 153.54,
          "end": 156.16,
          "en": "This is a prop exposed by React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 156.16,
          "end": 158.72,
          "en": "which wants a function as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 158.72,
          "end": 160.54,
          "en": "a pointer at a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 160.54,
          "end": 164.18,
          "en": "In my case, I'll point at this goalInputHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 164.18,
          "end": 166.62,
          "en": "So I'll pass that as a value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "and I'll press the auto format shortcut",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 170.06,
          "en": "to make this a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 171.3,
          "end": 174.7,
          "en": "Now, please note that I don't execute this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 174.7,
          "end": 177.01,
          "en": "I don't add parentheses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 177.01,
          "end": 178.7,
          "en": "If you would add parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 178.7,
          "end": 180.55,
          "en": "this function would be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 180.55,
          "end": 184.33,
          "en": "as soon as this code is parsed and evaluated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 184.33,
          "end": 185.56,
          "en": "And this would be too soon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 185.56,
          "end": 187.06,
          "en": "because that would be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 187.06,
          "end": 189.4,
          "en": "when this user interface is rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 189.4,
          "end": 190.66,
          "en": "I don't wanna do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 190.66,
          "end": 192.86,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna point at this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 192.86,
          "end": 195.24,
          "en": "so that React can execute it for me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 195.24,
          "end": 198.84,
          "en": "whenever this text changes in this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 198.84,
          "end": 199.91,
          "en": "and that's what will happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 199.91,
          "end": 201.333,
          "en": "if we set it up like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 202.88,
          "end": 205.97,
          "en": "Now in this goalInputHandler function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 205.97,
          "end": 209.37,
          "en": "we then receive the entered value automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 210.26,
          "en": "because keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 210.26,
          "end": 212.62,
          "en": "it will be React that calls this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 212.62,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "because it's React Native that exposes this prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 217.07,
          "en": "And therefore, React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 217.07,
          "end": 218.95,
          "en": "or to be precise React Native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 218.95,
          "end": 221.86,
          "en": "will also provide us a value as a input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 221.86,
          "end": 223.8,
          "en": "as a parameter to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 223.8,
          "end": 226.22,
          "en": "and that will be the enteredText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 226.22,
          "end": 229.31,
          "en": "So we get the enteredText automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 229.31,
          "end": 230.94,
          "en": "And then we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 230.94,
          "end": 233.13,
          "en": "console.log this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 233.13,
          "end": 234.053,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 235.5,
          "end": 236.89,
          "en": "If we save this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 236.89,
          "end": 239.623,
          "en": "and we have the npm-start process up and running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 240.6,
          "end": 242.33,
          "en": "we can go back here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 242.33,
          "end": 243.163,
          "en": "And for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 243.163,
          "end": 244.38,
          "en": "enter Test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 244.38,
          "end": 245.89,
          "en": "And as I type this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 245.89,
          "end": 249.67,
          "en": "you see the log update here in my terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 249.67,
          "end": 252.543,
          "en": "with every keystroke until we have the word Test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 253.52,
          "end": 254.74,
          "en": "So that's how this works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 254.74,
          "end": 257.89,
          "en": "and this works totally on its own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 257.89,
          "end": 260.25,
          "en": "So that's how we can get the entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 260.25,
          "end": 262.45,
          "en": "Of course, we don't want to get the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 262.45,
          "end": 264.67,
          "en": "because we need it in this function though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 264.67,
          "end": 266.61,
          "en": "Instead, we need it in this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 266.61,
          "end": 268.66,
          "en": "So we need it when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 269.56,
          "end": 270.39300000000003,
          "en": "And for this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 270.39300000000003,
          "end": 271.44,
          "en": "we need to connect this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 271.44,
          "end": 273.373,
          "en": "to a button click as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 274.23,
          "end": 276.27,
          "en": "Now, if you would be building a web app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 276.27,
          "end": 278.5,
          "en": "and you had a HTML button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 278.5,
          "end": 280.43,
          "en": "you would add the onClick prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 281.33,
          "end": 282.81,
          "en": "but with React Native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 282.81,
          "end": 284.713,
          "en": "this prop doesn't exist on a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 285.61,
          "end": 287.15,
          "en": "But we have a similar prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 287.15,
          "end": 289.35,
          "en": "it's called onPress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 289.35,
          "end": 291.61,
          "en": "It's called onPress instead of onClick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 291.61,
          "end": 293.88,
          "en": "because technically we don't have clicks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 293.88,
          "end": 295.65,
          "en": "in native mobile apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 295.65,
          "end": 298.243,
          "en": "Instead, we have taps or presses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 299.21,
          "end": 300.77,
          "en": "So here we have onPress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 300.77,
          "end": 302.7,
          "en": "And just as with onChangeText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 302.7,
          "end": 306.36,
          "en": "here I point at my function that should be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 306.36,
          "end": 308.66,
          "en": "In this case, addGoalHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 308.66,
          "end": 310.24,
          "en": "So now this function will be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 310.24,
          "end": 312.693,
          "en": "whenever the button is clicked or tapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 313.69,
          "end": 315.86,
          "en": "Now we want the value entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 315.86,
          "end": 316.89,
          "en": "in this TextInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 316.89,
          "end": 318.49,
          "en": "in this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 318.49,
          "end": 319.92,
          "en": "So what we need to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 319.92,
          "end": 322.78,
          "en": "is we need to store it as state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 322.78,
          "end": 324.83,
          "en": "We need to store it as state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 324.83,
          "end": 328.21,
          "en": "which is updated with every keystroke in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 328.21,
          "end": 329.5,
          "en": "so that we can then use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
